ODINMOO — License

ODINMOO is a from-scratch rewrite in Odin of the LambdaMOO server. It is a
derivative work of LambdaMOO and is distributed under the same terms that
LambdaMOO itself was released under. Those terms are reproduced verbatim from the
original C source's file headers below, followed by the notice covering the new
Odin code in this repository.

